    Python path is preserved in every else-branch. Dispatched to qwen3.8:27b,
    reviewed (verify 12/12 VERIFY_OK, scope clean); first dispatch through the
    deployed two-tier gate. The 27B re-gate raised 2 'concerns' that are false
    positives (relocated/generalized literals mis-read as removed) -- see vault.

